  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped bell pepper and cook until tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the Italian fennel sausages and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the smoked paprika, cumin, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
